00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:40.610
Dad and...

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:44.570
Ayanami Rei.

00:15:44.570 --> 00:15:49.830
How was Rei?

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:54.020
She went to the hospital in the afternoon, didn't she?

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:56.620
She'll be able to move in 20 days.

00:15:56.620 --> 00:16:00.000
Until then, she'll be able to reinstall the 0th unit during the freeze.

00:16:01.340 --> 00:16:04.420
It must be painful for those children.

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:07.140
Don't let the peace move you.

00:16:07.140 --> 00:16:10.270
You're alive, so do it.

00:16:10.270 --> 00:16:12.160
The will of these children is unwavering.

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:34.480
Yes, that's what he's looking at.

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:36.820
I wonder if he'll ride it again.

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:42.270
I'm scared to see his eyes.

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:44.210
