00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:26.310
Wow!

00:20:34.440 --> 00:20:37.270
That's the real Eva.

00:21:37.420 --> 00:21:39.670
Shinji-kun, I'm going to open it.

00:21:39.670 --> 00:21:49.140
I forgot to tell you one thing, but you did a great job of being praised by people.

00:21:49.140 --> 00:21:50.680
You can put your heart into it.

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:53.590
Good night, Shinji-kun.

00:21:53.590 --> 00:21:57.080
Do your best.

